<item>
<title>韩国“习近平”餐馆遭袭  4名中国人当天逃回国  韩媒：引渡恐难实现韩国首尔近郊一家名为“习近平”的中餐馆，9月24日凌</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10266</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10266</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:35:49 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>韩国“习近平”餐馆遭袭  4名中国人当天逃回国</b>  <b>韩媒：引渡恐难实现</b><br/><br/>韩国首尔近郊一家名为“习近平”的中餐馆，9月24日凌晨遭4名中国籍男子闯入破坏，店内被喷漆，食材被洒疑似农药，警方怀疑与店名有关。据韩媒，4人案发前分两批入境，警方认为他们看准中秋休业下手，当天即从仁川飞回中国。<br/><br/>店主称因习近平是中国最高领导人，取名寓意中餐第一，无嘲讽之意，且餐厅名已使用8年；自去年起接到三四十通抗议电话，今年4月有人举报该店以店名及&quot;习近平特色饭&quot;等菜名谋利，但韩国知识产权处查无违法；7月招牌又遭涂黑。警方28日申请逮捕令，韩媒指嫌犯恐难归案：中韩签引渡条约以来中方从未配合韩方引渡。<br/><br/>韩国学者李在默说，在中国拿领导人名字开餐馆可能被视为侮辱。店主29日已改名复业。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB">#政治</a> <a href="?q=%23%E4%B9%A0%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3">#习近平</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4">#外交</a> <a href="?q=%23%E9%9F%A9%E5%9B%BD">#韩国</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《韩国中央日报》<a href="https://www.koreajoongangdaily.com/korea/four-chinese-nationals-vandalized-chinese-restaurant-xi-jinping-in-bundang-police-say/12893075" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Four Chinese nationals vandalized Chinese restaurant ‘Xi Jinping’ in Bundang, police say</a><br/>《韩国中央日报》<a href="https://mbiz.heraldcorp.com/article/10886143" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Seongnam restaurant named after Xi Jinping to rebrand after alleged vandalism attack<br/></a>《韩国先驱经济》<a href="https://mbiz.heraldcorp.com/article/10886143" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Why a Seongnam Chinese restaurant used Xi Jinping&#39;s name — and paid the price<br/></a>《韩国亚洲日报》<a href="https://www.ajudaily.com/view/20260928133200762" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">韩警方拟对在盆唐中餐厅实施破坏的4名中国籍嫌疑人申请逮捕令</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/QiUheK7ET3O_C-7Hjn4LSv5mlsalHG3DycTJMBv4oYl2f-rwNs5vtiVcg4VkcnFSns1NQhfgQgmByVYrzeicjBc7_KaAVUX2SFZGjbROF